# Copy to .bar.env (it is not committed) to tell tools/bar.sh where the bar is.
# BAR_LAN=192.168.1.20          # the bar's fixed address on your network, if it has one (it is also found by name and by a sweep)
# The bar only reachable through a jump host and the machine it is plugged into (e.g. a Raspberry Pi over USB):
# BAR_JUMP=jump.example.com
# BAR_PI=user@192.168.2.10
# BAR_BEHIND=10.0.4.20          # the bar as that machine sees it
# BAR_TOKEN=<api token>         # for push.sh, if the bar asks for one
